{"id":"620605","name":"腊肠煲仔饭","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/620605/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"麻辣香肠","amount":"2条"},{"name":"五常大米","amount":"3杯"}],"sub":[{"name":"清水","amount":"4.5杯"},{"name":"玉米粒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"植物油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"腊肠煮熟切片。","img":"images/620605/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"大米泡三个小时。","img":"images/620605/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"沥干水。","img":"images/620605/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"砂锅底抹油。","img":"images/620605/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入大米，加4.5杯清水。","img":"images/620605/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"中火烧开，改小火。","img":"images/620605/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"几分钟水就快干了，饭快熟了。","img":"images/620605/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放上腊肠。","img":"images/620605/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放上玉米粒，再煲五分钟。","img":"images/620605/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"满屋漂香，开吃。","img":"images/620605/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}